The order of the library functions and the meaning of the .otag tags follow
freetype2.library 1.x (AROS Development Team, from ft2.library for MorphOS
by Emmanuel Lesueur and ttf.library by Richard Griffith), so that existing
programs and font installations keep working. No code was copied from it.
